"0 = deterministic greedy. 0.6–1.0 typical chat. Above 1.0 gets erratic. Applies to the app's chats immediately; also becomes the server default for external clients that omit temperature (Claude Code) after a restart." = "0 = 確定性貪婪。0.6–1.0 為典型對話範圍。超過 1.0 會變得不穩定。立即套用至本 App 的對話；重新啟動後，也會成為外部客戶端（如 Claude Code）未指定 temperature 時的伺服器預設值。";
