"Bypass the safety check that refuses to load an MLX model when free RAM looks too low for its weights plus warmup headroom. The check is conservative — macOS reclaims file cache as the model loads — so turn this on if a load you know fits is being refused. A genuine over-commit can hard-crash the server. Passes --skip-mem-preflight." = "略過安全檢查，該檢查會在可用 RAM 對於模型權重加上暖機空間而言過低時，拒絕載入 MLX 模型。此檢查較為保守——macOS 會在模型載入時回收檔案快取——因此，如果您確定模型能載入卻被拒絕，請開啟此選項。真正的記憶體過度承諾可能導致伺服器當機。將傳遞 --skip-mem-preflight。";
"Cancel" = "取消";
