"DeepSeek‑V4‑Flash ships its own 3‑stage speculative draft (DSpark). Enabling it loads about 11 GB of extra draft weights at startup, so it stays off unless you turn it on — and the server still refuses when the Mac doesn't have the memory for model + draft + working room, serving normally instead. For DeepSeek‑V4 GGUF files this arms the embedded ds4 engine's DSpark runtime instead, using the DSpark support GGUF downloaded beside the model (nothing happens without that file). Only affects DeepSeek‑V4 models; greedy (temperature 0) requests only." = "DeepSeek‑V4‑Flash 自帶 3 階段投機性草稿（DSpark）。啟用後會在啟動時載入約 11 GB 的額外草稿權重，因此預設為關閉，除非您手動開啟——且當 Mac 記憶體不足以容納模型 + 草稿 + 工作空間時，伺服器仍會拒絕啟用，並改為正常服務。對於 DeepSeek‑V4 GGUF 檔案，此設定將啟用內嵌 ds4 引擎的 DSpark 執行時，使用與模型並排下載的 DSpark 支援 GGUF（若無該檔案則無效）。僅影響 DeepSeek‑V4 模型；僅適用於貪婪（temperature 0）請求。";
"Default the chat client to send `enable_thinking: true`. Only models with reasoning support honor this." = "預設讓聊天客戶端傳送 `enable_thinking: true`。僅支援推理的模型會遵循此設定。";
