"Hot prefix cache size: how many separate KV snapshots to keep across requests. Lets multi-turn chats skip re-prefilling shared system prompts. 0 disables. Auto-capped on RAM-limited Macs (a 16 GB Mac caps to 1) — on hybrid SSM models each entry pins large KV + state snapshots that can otherwise fill memory." = "熱前綴快取大小：跨請求保留多少個獨立的 KV 快照。讓多輪對話跳過重新預填充共享的系統提示詞。設為 0 可停用。在記憶體受限的 Mac 上會自動設上限（16 GB 的 Mac 上限為 1）——在混合 SSM 模型中，每個項目會固定大型 KV + 狀態快照，否則可能耗盡記憶體。";
"How can I help you today?" = "今天想讓我怎麼幫你？";
"How many independent llama.cpp KV contexts to keep resident. 1 = legacy single-session (every flip between long prompts evicts the other). >1 keeps the N most-recently-used prompts hot — alternating multi-doc workloads stop cold-prefilling on every flip." = "保留多少個獨立的 llama.cpp KV 上下文處於常駐狀態。1 = 傳統單一会話（在長提示詞之間切換時會逐出另一個）。大於 1 會保持最近使用的 N 個提示詞處於熱狀態——交替處理多文件工作負載時，不再於每次切換時進行冷預填充。";
"How many models the server keeps resident before it evicts the least-recently-used one to make room for the next. Switching models in the composer's picker never explicitly unloads the old one — it relies on this cap. Set to 1 so every switch unloads the previous model first, freeing its memory immediately. Passes --max-resident-models." = "伺服器在逐出最久未使用的模型以騰出空間給下一個模型之前，保留多少個模型處於常駐狀態。在編輯器的選擇器中切換模型時，從不明顯卸載舊模型——它依賴此上限。設為 1，使每次切換先卸載前一個模型，立即釋放其記憶體。傳遞 --max-resident-models。";
"How many tokens the MTP head guesses per step. Automatic (recommended) tunes this live — it guesses deeper while the model keeps accepting the guesses and backs off when it doesn't. Pick a fixed number only if you're measuring performance." = "MTP 頭部每步猜測多少個 token。自動（建議）會即時調整此值——當模型持續接受猜測時會猜測得更深，當不接受時則退縮。僅在測量效能時才選擇固定數值。";
