"Model memory cap" = "模型記憶體上限";
"Models" = "模型";
"Multi-Token Prediction (recommended)" = "多 Token 預測（建議）";
"My cloned voice" = "我的克隆語音";
"N-gram match key length for PLD lookup (default 3). Shorter keys = more matches, lower precision." = "PLD 查詢用的 N-gram 匹配鍵長度（預設值為 3）。鍵越短，匹配次數越多，但精確度越低。";
