"New Chat" = "新增對話";
"New versions ship on the project's GitHub releases page. Installing downloads the notarized app, swaps it in place, and relaunches — chats, models, and settings are untouched." = "新版本發布於專案的 GitHub Releases 頁面。安裝時會下載已簽署的應用程式，原地替換並重新啟動——對話、模型和設定均不受影響。";
"No cloud, no API keys. All processing stays on your device." = "不使用雲端，也不需要 API 金鑰。所有處理都留在你的裝置上。";
"No drafter for the MoE Gemma 4 — it regresses decode there. Use PLD instead." = "MoE Gemma 4 無草稿模型——在那裡使用會導致解碼效能倒退。請改用 PLD。";
"Nucleus sampling threshold. 0.95 keeps all but the long tail. 1.0 disables top-p filtering. Also the server default for external clients that omit top_p (restart needed for that part)." = "Nucleus 取樣閾值。0.95 保留除長尾外的所有選項。1.0 停用 top-p 過濾。同時也是外部客戶端省略 top_p 時的伺服器預設值（該部分需重新啟動才生效）。";
"OFF = plain chat (safe). ON = the bot can run shell commands and read/write files on this Mac, triggered from your phone. Confined to ~/.mlx-serve/telegram-workspace. Only enable if you understand the risk — anyone who can message the locked chat gets this power." = "關閉 = 一般聊天（安全）。開啟 = 機器人可在此 Mac 上執行 shell 指令並讀寫檔案，由您的手機觸發。限制在 ~/.mlx-serve/telegram-workspace 內。僅在您了解風險時開啟——任何能向鎖定聊天室傳訊息的人都會獲得此權限。";
"OFF = the agent runs shell commands directly on macOS (fast, full access to your files). ON = commands run inside an isolated Linux sandbox that can only touch the current working folder, so a bad command can't harm the rest of your Mac. Costs a bit more memory while active because it spins up a lightweight virtual machine for the session." = "關閉 = 代理程式直接在 macOS 上執行 shell 指令（快速，可完全存取您的檔案）。開啟 = 指令在隔離的 Linux 沙箱中執行，僅能存取目前工作資料夾，因此錯誤指令不會影響 Mac 的其他部分。啟用時會因啟動輕量虛擬機器而消耗稍多記憶體。";
"OK" = "確定";
"ON = the sandbox has outbound internet (NAT), and any server the agent starts inside it is automatically reachable on this Mac at localhost with the same port — e.g. a dev server on 8080 appears at localhost:8080 (bound to localhost only, never your LAN). OFF = the sandbox gets no network device at all: fully isolated, but installs and downloads inside it will fail. Applies to the next sandbox session." = "開啟 = 沙箱具備出站網路（NAT），代理程式在內部啟動的任何伺服器都會自動在此 Mac 的 localhost 上以相同埠號可達——例如 8080 埠的開發伺服器會顯示在 localhost:8080（僅綁定 localhost，絕不連到您的區域網路）。關閉 = 沙箱完全沒有網路裝置：完全隔離，但內部的安裝與下載將失敗。適用於下一個沙箱工作階段。";
"ON = tools are opt-in: a chat only gets them when you turn the wrench (or MCP) on yourself, and sending a message that looks like a task — \\\"make me a website\\\", \\\"npm install react\\\" — no longer stops to ask whether to enable Tools or MCP first. OFF = that suggestion still appears before such a message is sent. Either way the toolbar toggles, and any agent that decides them for its tab, are unchanged." = "開啟 = 工具為選取式：聊天僅在您自行開啟扳手（或 MCP）時才啟用，且傳送看似任務的訊息——如「幫我建立一個網站」、「npm install react」——不再暫停詢問是否先啟用工具或 MCP。關閉 = 傳送此類訊息前仍會顯示該建議。無論如何，工具列切換開關，以及任何為其分頁決定此設定的代理程式，皆維持不變。";
"Off (F16, libllama default)" = "關閉（F16，libllama 預設）";
