"Pairs with the small assistant drafter for +27–40% on code & agents (dense Gemma 4 only). On automatically: \\(r.url.lastPathComponent)." = "與小型助理草稿器配對，可為程式碼與代理程式提升 27–40%（僅限密集 Gemma 4）。自動開啟：\\(r.url.lastPathComponent)。";
"Paste the token @BotFather gives you after /newbot. Stored locally on this Mac and sent only to Telegram's API." = "貼上 @BotFather 在 /newbot 後給您的 token。儲存在此 Mac 本地，僅傳送至 Telegram API。";
"Path to a Gemma 4 assistant drafter directory (gemma-4-*-it-assistant-bf16). Must pair with a Gemma 4 target. Empty = no drafter." = "Gemma 4 助理草稿器目錄的路徑（gemma-4-*-it-assistant-bf16）。必須與 Gemma 4 目標配對。空白 = 無草稿器。";
"Penalty multiplier for tokens already in the context. 1.0 = none. 1.1 is a typical anti-repeat setting." = "已存在於上下文中 token 的懲罰倍數。1.0 = 無。1.1 是典型的防重複設定。";
"Per-LoadedModel LRU of chat-template render+tokenize results. Skips re-rendering identical message lists on warm reuse — drops warm tokenize_ms from ~240 ms to ~0 on long-prompt repeats. Applies to all engines. 0 disables." = "每個 LoadedModel 的聊天模板渲染與 tokenize 結果 LRU 快取。在熱重用時跳過重新渲染相同訊息列表——長提示詞重複時，熱 tokenize_ms 從約 240 ms 降至約 0。適用於所有引擎。0 為停用。";
"Per-request PLD" = "每請求 PLD";
"Per-request drafter" = "每請求草稿模型";
"Persist seen KV prefixes to disk (~/.mlx-serve/kv-cache) so they survive restarts + RAM evictions — turns a cold 30-50s long-context first-token wait into a fast SSD read. OFF by default because it can use many gigabytes of disk." = "將已見 KV 前綴持久化至磁碟（~/.mlx-serve/kv-cache），使其在重新啟動與 RAM 逐出後仍保留——將冷啟動時 30–50 秒的長上下文首 token 等待轉為快速的 SSD 讀取。預設關閉，因為可能佔用數 GB 磁碟空間。";
