"Presence penalty" = "存在懲罰";
"Prompt Lookup Decoding. Big wins on echo-heavy workloads (code editing, RAG, agent loops). The adaptive prompt-time gate auto-disables it on novel content. On models with a native MTP head, MTP takes priority and PLD stays dormant — except MoE models (e.g. 35B-A3B), where PLD is the default speedup." = "提示詞查表解碼（Prompt Lookup Decoding）。在回顯密集的工作負載（程式碼編輯、RAG、代理迴圈）上效益顯著。自適應提示詞時間閘門會在遇到新穎內容時自動停用此功能。在具備原生 MTP 頭的模型上，MTP 優先啟用，PLD 保持休眠——但 MoE 模型（例如 35B-A3B）除外，PLD 為其預設加速方式。";
"Q4_0 (≈4× smaller, some quality cost)" = "Q4_0（約小 4 倍，略有品質損失）";
"Q8_0 (≈2× smaller, near-lossless)" = "Q8_0（約小 2 倍，近乎無損）";
"Qwen 3.5 / 3.8 models that ship a trained MTP head guess several of the next tokens at once and check them all in a single pass — typically a big speed-up on replies, with output identical to normal decoding. It switches on by itself for models that have the head, and does nothing for models that don't, so there's rarely a reason to turn it off." = "Qwen 3.5 / 3.8 模型若內建訓練好的 MTP 頭，會一次猜測多個後續 token 並在一趟中全部驗證——通常可大幅加速回應，且輸出與一般解碼完全相同。對具備該頭的模型會自動啟用，對不具備的模型則無作用，因此幾乎沒有理由關閉它。";
