"Require this key for requests from OTHER machines (the OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama APIs + index page + metrics). Sent as Authorization: Bearer, x-api-key, HTTP Basic, or ?api_key=. Localhost is trusted, so this app never needs it — it protects the server when exposed on the network. Blank = no auth." = "要求來自其他機器（OpenAI/Anthropic/Ollama API + 索引頁面 + 指標）的請求提供此金鑰。金鑰會以 Authorization: Bearer、x-api-key、HTTP Basic 或 ?api_key= 傳送。本機（localhost）受信任，因此此應用程式從不需要金鑰——它用於保護暴露在網路上的伺服器。留空 = 無驗證。";
"Reset sandbox" = "重設沙箱";
"Restart the server to apply this change" = "重新啟動伺服器以套用此變更";
"Retry" = "重試";
"Run models locally" = "在本機執行模型";
"Running" = "執行中";
"Runs part of long-prompt processing on the Apple Neural Engine in parallel with the GPU, so big prompts start answering sooner — measured 19–26% faster prompt processing at 16k–32k tokens on an M4 Max with Qwen family models (4, 6 and 8-bit builds alike). Reply speed is unchanged. The Neural Engine keeps its own copy of part of the model's math — roughly 11 GB extra for a 27B, around 1 GB for a small model — and the server checks that exact fit at load, declining by name when this Mac can't hold it. First load of a model adds a one-time compile of about 1–2 minutes. Models it can't accelerate simply serve normally. Not recommended on M5-family Macs yet: their GPUs carry neural accelerator (NAX) cores that already speed up prompt processing, so the Neural Engine's extra help shrinks to little or nothing there." = "在 Apple 神經引擎上與 GPU 並行執行部分長提示詞處理，讓大型提示詞更快開始回覆——在 M4 Max 上使用 Qwen 系列模型（4、6 及 8 位元版本皆然）處理 16k–32k tokens 時，實測提示詞處理速度提升 19–26%。回覆速度不變。神經引擎會保留模型部分運算的獨立副本——27B 模型約需額外 11 GB，小型模型約需 1 GB——伺服器會在載入時檢查該精確配置，若此 Mac 無法容納則會依名稱拒絕。首次載入模型會增加約 1–2 分鐘的一次性編譯時間。無法加速的模型將照常服務。目前尚不建議在 M5 系列 Mac 上使用：其 GPU 已內建神經加速器（NAX）核心，可加速提示詞處理，因此神經引擎的額外幫助在那裡將微乎其微或完全消失。";
"SSD cache size" = "SSD 快取大小";
