"Server log verbosity. Use 'debug' to capture Jinja errors, KV cache hits and per-request token counts." = "伺服器記錄詳細程度。使用 'debug' 以擷取 Jinja 錯誤、KV 快取命中及每請求 token 數。";
"Server-launch flags. Restart the server to apply changes." = "伺服器啟動參數。重新啟動伺服器以套用變更。";
"Serves decode from quantized copies of attention weights that ship un-quantized (bf16): 8-bit for most layers, 4-bit for the last fifth, where quantization error matters far less. Models like poolside Laguna decode ~25% faster overall. Slightly lossy: replies can differ in wording from the exact bf16 decode, but measured answers stay the same quality (prompt reading and speculative checks keep the exact weights). Flipping this ON (rather than leaving it untouched) also enables DeepSeek-V4's compressor-input requant — ~7% faster decode there, with rare wording-level artifacts. Models with fully quantized attention are unaffected. Turn off for bit-exact bf16 decoding." = "從未量化（bf16）的注意力權重的量化副本提供解碼：大部分層使用 8 位元，最後五分之一使用 4 位元，因為該處的量化誤差影響遠較小。像 poolside Laguna 這樣的模型整體解碼速度約快 25%。輕微有損：回覆的用詞可能與精確的 bf16 解碼不同，但實測答案品質保持不變（提示詞讀取與猜測檢查仍使用精確權重）。開啟此選項（而非保持未動）也會啟用 DeepSeek-V4 的壓縮器輸入重新量化——該處解碼速度約快 7%，偶爾出現用詞層面的瑕疵。注意力權重已完全量化的模型不受影響。關閉以獲得位元精確的 bf16 解碼。";
"Session cache entries" = "工作階段快取項目";
