"Stream DeepSeek-V4-Flash expert weights from SSD instead of holding the whole model in RAM (skips full residency + warmup). Turn on when the model is larger than available memory — it loads instead of OOMing, trading some decode speed for the disk reads. ds4 / DeepSeek-V4-Flash only; ignored by the MLX and llama.cpp engines. Passes --ssd-streaming." = "從 SSD 串流 DeepSeek-V4-Flash 專家權重，而非將整個模型保留在 RAM 中（略過完整駐留與暖機）。當模型大於可用記憶體時開啟——它會載入而非記憶體不足（OOM），以部分解碼速度換取磁碟讀取。僅適用於 ds4 / DeepSeek-V4-Flash；MLX 和 llama.cpp 引擎會忽略此設定。傳遞 --ssd-streaming。";
