"The built-in macOS voice. No download and no GPU, but the least natural of the three." = "macOS 內建語音。無需下載且不使用 GPU，但三者中自然度最低。";
"The default working folder for the agent's tools (shell, readFile, writeFile, …) in every chat — and the folder shared into the sandbox VM at /workspace while the sandbox is on. Changing it moves chats still on the previous default, remounts a running sandbox, and restarts any open terminal sessions in the new folder; a chat with its own picked folder (the folder icon on the Agent pill) keeps it." = "每個對話中代理工具（shell、readFile、writeFile、…）的預設工作資料夾——也是沙箱開啟時共享到沙箱虛擬機器 /workspace 的資料夾。變更後，仍使用先前預設的對話會移至新資料夾，正在運行的沙箱會重新掛載，且在新資料夾中重新啟動任何開啟的終端機工作階段；已自行選擇資料夾的對話（Agent 膠囊上的資料夾圖示）將保留原設定。";
